                        "the API (about 2 MB instead of a terminal's 200 to 400 MB). Its tools run in the service's environment. The default of a plain launch (see --terminal); "
                        "unlike the default, an explicit --headless never falls back to a terminal")
    launch.add_argument("--terminal", action="store_true", help="Open a herdr tab for the worker (a plain launch is headless unless the configuration key "
                        "launch_default is terminal). Cannot be combined with --headless; --workspace and --new-workspace imply it")
