                        help="ONE extra repository the worker may READ (issue view, pr view, api GET...) as that repository's gh_users account; every write "
                             "there, every command that names another repository and `gh search|gist|status|...` are refused by the gh and git shims. Exact lower-case owner/name. A shim guard, not a GitHub guard")
    launch.add_argument("--new-workspace", dest="new_workspace", metavar="LABEL",
