                        "request is merged")
    # Every `add_<name>_parsers(sub)` function of this module registers its commands: nothing is listed here, so a new command adds no shared line
    # (the registrations used to be a list that every slice appended to, and any two in-flight slices conflicted on it). Alphabetical by function name.
    for registrar in command_registrars():
